<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>حلا | متجر الأناقة والجمال</title>
<meta name="description" content="حلا — متجر راقي للفساتين والحقائب والمكياج والإكسسوارات. توصيل مجاني وإرجاع سهل.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;900&family=Tajawal:wght@300;400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#faf6f1; --surface:#ffffff; --cream:#f2ead9; --sand:#ece2d0;
    --blush:#ecd5d5; --rose:#c98a8a; --rose-deep:#a86b6b;
    --terracotta:#c47a5c; --terra-dark:#a05f45;
    --sage:#9baa87; --olive:#70805a;
    --burgundy:#7a2e3e; --plum:#4a2f3a; --ink:#2b1e24;
    --muted:#8b7a82; --gold:#b8925a; --gold-light:#d9bd8a;
    --line:rgba(184,146,90,.2);
    --shadow-sm:0 8px 24px -18px rgba(74,47,58,.5);
    --shadow:0 20px 44px -28px rgba(74,47,58,.6);
    --shadow-lg:0 32px 60px -32px rgba(74,47,58,.7);
    --radius:20px; --radius-lg:28px;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:'Tajawal',system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.85;overflow-x:hidden}
  h1,h2,h3,h4,.logo{font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;line-height:1.4}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block}
  a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
  button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:none;background:none;color:inherit}
  ul{list-style:none}
  input,select,textarea{font-family:inherit}
  ::selection{background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff}
  body.no-scroll{overflow:hidden}
  .container{width:min(1240px,92%);margin-inline:auto}

  /* شريط الإعلان */
  .announce{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);text-align:center;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:500;padding:.65rem 1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .announce em{color:var(--gold-light);font-style:normal;font-weight:700}
  .count-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;background:rgba(184,146,90,.18);border:1px solid rgba(184,146,90,.35);padding:.15rem .7rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.75rem;color:var(--gold-light);font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-weight:700}
  .count-pill b{background:var(--gold-light);color:var(--plum);padding:.05rem .4rem;border-radius:5px;font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif;min-width:26px;display:inline-block;text-align:center}

  /* الهيدر */
  header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:80;background:rgba(250,246,241,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(16px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .nav-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.9rem 0}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--plum)}
  .logo .mark{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(140deg,var(--terracotta),var(--burgundy));display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:1.1rem;box-shadow:0 10px 22px -12px rgba(122,46,62,.7);transition:transform .35s}
  .logo:hover .mark{transform:rotate(-8deg) scale(1.05)}
  .logo .name{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--plum),var(--burgundy));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}

  nav ul{display:flex;gap:1.7rem;font-size:.93rem;font-weight:600}
  nav a{position:relative;padding:.35rem 0;color:var(--plum);transition:color .25s}
  nav a::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;right:0;height:2px;width:0;border-radius:2px;background:var(--terracotta);transition:width .3s ease}
  nav a:hover{color:var(--terracotta)}
  nav a:hover::after{width:100%}

  .header-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
  .icon-btn{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--surface);font-size:1rem;color:var(--plum);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:transform .25s, background .25s, color .25s, box-shadow .25s;position:relative}
  .icon-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);background:var(--cream);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .icon-btn svg{width:19px;height:19px;stroke-width:1.8}
  .badge-count{position:absolute;top:-4px;left:-4px;min-width:20px;height:20px;padding:0 5px;background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff;border-radius:999px;font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center;border:2px solid var(--bg);font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif}
  .badge-count.hidden{display:none}
  .burger{display:none;font-size:1.2rem}

  /* أزرار */
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.88rem 1.9rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;transition:transform .25s, box-shadow .25s, background .25s, color .25s, border-color .25s;border:1.5px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap}
  .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--terracotta),var(--burgundy));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 32px -18px rgba(122,46,62,.85)}
  .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 24px 40px -18px rgba(122,46,62,.9)}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--plum);border-color:var(--plum)}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);transform:translateY(-3px)}
  .btn-gold{background:var(--gold);color:var(--plum)}
  .btn-gold:hover{background:var(--gold-light);transform:translateY(-3px)}
  .btn-sm{padding:.6rem 1.25rem;font-size:.82rem}
  .btn-block{width:100%}

  /* الهيرو */
  .hero{position:relative;padding:3.5rem 0 4.5rem;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 20%, rgba(236,213,213,.5), transparent 55%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 75%, rgba(155,170,135,.28), transparent 55%),var(--bg);overflow:hidden;min-height:640px}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:3rem;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:2}

  .eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;background:var(--surface);color:var(--burgundy);font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;padding:.5rem 1.15rem;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:1.3rem}
  .eyebrow::before{content:'';width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold)}

  .hero-slide{display:none;animation:fadeSlide .7s ease}
  .hero-slide.active{display:block}
  @keyframes fadeSlide{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.3rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.3;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:1.1rem}
  .grad{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--terracotta),var(--burgundy));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
  .hero p.lead{font-size:1.02rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:46ch;margin-bottom:2rem;line-height:1.95}
  .btn-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.8rem;align-items:center}

  .hero-stats{display:flex;gap:2.2rem;margin-top:2.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .hero-stats > div{padding-inline-start:1.2rem;border-inline-start:2px solid var(--gold-light)}
  .hero-stats strong{display:block;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-size:1.55rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--burgundy);line-height:1.2}
  .hero-stats span{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}

  .hero-dots{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-top:2rem}
  .hero-dot{width:26px;height:4px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(74,47,58,.2);transition:all .4s}
  .hero-dot.active{background:var(--terracotta);width:44px}

  .hero-visual{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center}
  .hero-card{width:min(100%,380px);aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:32px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,var(--cream),var(--blush) 55%,var(--sage));display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:8.5rem;border:1px solid rgba(184,146,90,.3);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .hero-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.75), transparent 55%)}
  .hero-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:16px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.5);border-radius:22px;pointer-events:none;z-index:2}
  .hero-card .emoji-big{position:relative;z-index:1;animation:heroFloat 5s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes heroFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-10px)}}

  .chip{position:absolute;background:var(--surface);border-radius:14px;padding:.7rem 1.15rem;font-size:.79rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum);box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid var(--line);z-index:3}
  .chip::before{content:'';width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold)}
  .chip.c1{top:8%;right:-5%}
  .chip.c2{bottom:12%;left:-5%}
  .chip.c3{top:48%;left:-8%;animation:heroFloat 6s ease-in-out infinite .8s}

  /* شريط الثقة */
  .trust-strip{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);padding:1rem 0}
  .trust-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;align-items:center}
  .trust-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;font-size:.84rem;font-weight:500;color:rgba(242,234,217,.9)}
  .trust-item svg{width:18px;height:18px;stroke:var(--gold-light);stroke-width:1.8;flex-shrink:0}

  /* ماركات / صحافة */
  .press{background:var(--cream);padding:2.2rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
  .press-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-around;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5rem}
  .press-item{font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.05em;opacity:.75;transition:opacity .3s, color .3s;cursor:default}
  .press-item:hover{opacity:1;color:var(--plum)}

  /* عناوين الأقسام */
  section{padding:4.5rem 0;position:relative}
  .section-head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 2.8rem}
  .section-head .eyebrow{margin-bottom:.9rem}
  .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.5rem);font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.7rem}
  .section-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.96rem}

  /* الأقسام */
  .cats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:1rem}
  .cat{border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.9rem 1rem;text-align:center;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:transform .3s, box-shadow .3s, border-color .3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer}
  .cat::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;right:0;left:0;height:3px;background:var(--accent,var(--terracotta));transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:right;transition:transform .35s ease}
  .cat:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-color:transparent}
  .cat:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1)}
  .cat .emoji{width:60px;height:60px;margin:0 auto .9rem;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.8rem;background:var(--cat-bg,var(--cream));transition:transform .35s}
  .cat:hover .emoji{transform:scale(1.1) rotate(-5deg)}
  .cat h3{font-size:.98rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.1rem}
  .cat span{font-size:.76rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}

  /* شريط التبويبات */
  .tabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:2.5rem}
  .tab{padding:.65rem 1.5rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;background:var(--surface);color:var(--plum);border:1.5px solid var(--line);transition:all .25s}
  .tab:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--terracotta);color:var(--terracotta)}
  .tab.active{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);border-color:var(--plum)}

  /* شريط الأدوات */
  .shop-toolbar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:1.8rem}
  .filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem}
  .filter{padding:.5rem 1.15rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;background:var(--surface);color:var(--plum);border:1.5px solid var(--line);transition:all .25s}
  .filter:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--terracotta);color:var(--terracotta)}
  .filter.active{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);border-color:var(--plum)}
  .sort-box{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .sort-box select{padding:.5rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--plum);font-weight:600;font-size:.82rem;cursor:pointer;outline:none;transition:border-color .25s}
  .sort-box select:hover,.sort-box select:focus{border-color:var(--terracotta)}

  /* شبكة المنتجات */
  .products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(225px,1fr));gap:1.3rem}
  .product{background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:transform .35s, box-shadow .35s, border-color .35s;animation:pop .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.3) both;position:relative}
  @keyframes pop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .product:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);border-color:rgba(196,122,92,.35)}
  .thumb{aspect-ratio:1/1;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:4rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .5s ease;cursor:pointer}
  .thumb::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,.7), transparent 62%)}
  .product:hover .thumb{transform:scale(1.05)}
  .quick-view-hint{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:14px;transform:translate(-50%,14px);background:rgba(74,47,58,.92);color:var(--cream);padding:.42rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:600;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s, transform .3s;z-index:3;pointer-events:none;white-space:nowrap}
  .product:hover .quick-view-hint{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
  .badge{position:absolute;top:12px;inset-inline-start:12px;z-index:2;font-size:.66rem;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;padding:.28rem .72rem;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;background:var(--burgundy);letter-spacing:.02em}
  .badge.new{background:var(--olive)}
  .badge.hot{background:var(--terracotta)}
  .wish{position:absolute;top:11px;inset-inline-end:11px;z-index:3;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--plum);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:transform .25s, background .25s, color .25s}
  .wish svg{width:16px;height:16px;stroke-width:2;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;transition:fill .25s}
  .wish:hover{transform:scale(1.12)}
  .wish.on{background:var(--burgundy);color:#fff}
  .wish.on svg{fill:currentColor}

  .p-body{padding:.95rem 1.1rem 1.15rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.25rem;flex:1}
  .p-cat{font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--terracotta)}
  .p-name{font-size:.96rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum);line-height:1.5}
  .p-rate{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:.12em}
  .p-rate b{color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-size:.7rem;margin-inline-start:.3rem;letter-spacing:0}
  .p-foot{margin-top:auto;padding-top:.8rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .price{font-weight:900;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-size:1rem;color:var(--plum)}
  .price s{color:var(--muted);font-weight:400;font-size:.74rem;margin-inline-start:.3rem}
  .add{font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700;padding:.52rem .95rem;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap;background:var(--terracotta);transition:transform .25s, background .25s;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem}
  .add svg{width:13px;height:13px;stroke-width:2.2}
  .add:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:var(--burgundy)}

  .empty{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:3rem 1rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500}
  .empty span{font-size:2.5rem;display:block;margin-bottom:.6rem;opacity:.5}

  /* Featured Collection */
  .featured{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cream),var(--blush));border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:3rem 2.5rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:2rem;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .featured::before{content:'✿';position:absolute;font-size:16rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);top:-4rem;right:-3rem;line-height:1}
  .featured-content{position:relative;z-index:1}
  .featured h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.3rem);font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:.8rem}
  .featured p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.96rem;margin-bottom:1.8rem;max-width:46ch}
  .featured-visual{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.8rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
  .fv-item{aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:20px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:3rem;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}

  /* Lookbook */
  .lookbook{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);grid-template-rows:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1rem;height:600px}
  .look{border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:4rem;position:relative;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .4s;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .look:hover{transform:scale(1.02)}
  .look::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 50%,rgba(74,47,58,.6));opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s}
  .look:hover::after{opacity:1}
  .look-label{position:absolute;bottom:1.2rem;right:1.2rem;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-size:.95rem;z-index:2;opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px);transition:all .35s}
  .look:hover .look-label{opacity:1;transform:none}
  .look.large{grid-row:span 2;font-size:6rem}
  .look.wide{grid-column:span 2}

  /* العرض الخاص */
  .promo{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--plum),var(--burgundy));color:var(--cream);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:3rem 2.5rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:2rem;align-items:center}
  .promo::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-80px;right:-80px;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(196,122,92,.4), transparent 70%)}
  .promo::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-100px;left:-60px;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(155,170,135,.3), transparent 70%)}
  .promo-content{position:relative;z-index:2}
  .promo-tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--gold);color:var(--plum);font-size:.73rem;font-weight:900;padding:.32rem 1rem;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:1rem;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.04em}
  .promo h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.1rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:.7rem;color:var(--cream)}
  .promo p{opacity:.85;font-size:.93rem;margin-bottom:1.7rem;max-width:46ch}
  .timer{display:flex;gap:.6rem;position:relative;z-index:2;justify-content:center}
  .timer .unit{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(217,189,138,.35);border-radius:14px;padding:.85rem 1rem;text-align:center;min-width:72px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}
  .timer .unit b{display:block;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--gold-light);line-height:1}
  .timer .unit span{font-size:.68rem;color:rgba(242,234,217,.7);margin-top:.3rem;display:block}

  /* المزايا */
  .features-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:1.2rem}
  .feature{background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.9rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--line);transition:transform .3s, box-shadow .3s}
  .feature:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .feature .emoji{width:56px;height:56px;margin:0 auto .9rem;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.5rem;background:var(--cream)}
  .feature h3{font-size:1rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.4rem}
  .feature p{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted)}

  /* برنامج الولاء */
  .loyalty{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--cream),var(--blush));border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:3rem 2.5rem;border:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .loyalty::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-100px;left:-100px;width:300px;height:300px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(184,146,90,.2), transparent 70%)}
  .loyalty-head{text-align:center;margin-bottom:2.5rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
  .loyalty-head h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.2rem);font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.6rem}
  .loyalty-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem;max-width:52ch;margin-inline:auto}
  .tiers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1.3rem;position:relative;z-index:1}
  .tier{background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:2rem 1.5rem;text-align:center;border:1.5px solid var(--line);transition:transform .3s, box-shadow .3s, border-color .3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .tier:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .tier.featured-tier{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 24px 48px -32px rgba(184,146,90,.95)}
  .tier.featured-tier::before{content:'الأكثر اختياراً';position:absolute;top:14px;right:-30px;background:var(--gold);color:var(--plum);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:900;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;padding:.25rem 2.5rem;transform:rotate(45deg);letter-spacing:.03em}
  .tier .tier-icon{width:60px;height:60px;margin:0 auto .9rem;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.6rem;background:var(--cream)}
  .tier.bronze .tier-icon{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e6c9a8,#c9906b)}
  .tier.silver .tier-icon{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e2e2e2,#a8a8a8)}
  .tier.gold .tier-icon{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0dc9e,#c9a86a)}
  .tier h3{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.3rem}
  .tier .price-tag{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:900;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;color:var(--burgundy);margin-bottom:1rem}
  .tier .price-tag small{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif}
  .tier ul{display:grid;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;text-align:start}
  .tier li{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
  .tier li::before{content:'✓';color:var(--olive);font-weight:900;flex-shrink:0}

  /* آراء العميلات */
  .carousel-wrap{position:relative;max-width:960px;margin-inline:auto}
  .quotes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.2rem}
  .quote{background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.9rem 1.6rem;border:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;transition:transform .3s, box-shadow .3s}
  .quote:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .quote::before{content:'"';position:absolute;top:6px;inset-inline-start:18px;font-family:'Cairo',serif;font-size:4rem;color:var(--blush);line-height:1;font-weight:900}
  .quote .stars{color:var(--gold);font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.15em;margin-bottom:.6rem;position:relative}
  .quote p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:1.2rem;position:relative;line-height:1.9}
  .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem}
  .avatar{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-size:.85rem}
  .who strong{display:block;font-size:.86rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum)}
  .who span{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .carousel-dots{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1.6rem}
  .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(74,47,58,.2);transition:all .3s}
  .dot.active{background:var(--terracotta);width:26px;border-radius:5px}

  /* المدونة */
  .blog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem}
  .blog-card{background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);transition:transform .35s, box-shadow .35s;cursor:pointer}
  .blog-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
  .blog-thumb{aspect-ratio:16/10;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:3.5rem;position:relative}
  .blog-thumb::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.6), transparent 60%)}
  .blog-tag{position:absolute;top:12px;inset-inline-start:12px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--plum);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;padding:.28rem .75rem;border-radius:999px;z-index:2}
  .blog-body{padding:1.3rem 1.4rem 1.5rem}
  .blog-body .meta{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.5rem;display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:center}
  .blog-body h3{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:.6rem}
  .blog-body p{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:.9rem}
  .blog-body .read{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--terracotta);font-weight:700;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;transition:gap .25s}
  .blog-card:hover .read{gap:.7rem}

  /* إنستغرام */
  .insta-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:.7rem}
  .insta-item{aspect-ratio:1/1;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:2.2rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);transition:transform .35s}
  .insta-item::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 50%,rgba(74,47,58,.6));opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s}
  .insta-item .insta-icon{position:absolute;bottom:8px;right:8px;color:#fff;font-size:.85rem;z-index:2;opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s}
  .insta-item:hover{transform:scale(1.04)}
  .insta-item:hover::after,.insta-item:hover .insta-icon{opacity:1}

  /* الأسئلة الشائعة */
  .faq-list{max-width:820px;margin-inline:auto;display:grid;gap:.7rem}
  .faq-item{background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s}
  .faq-item:hover{border-color:var(--gold-light)}
  .faq-item.open{box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);border-color:var(--gold-light)}
  .faq-q{width:100%;text-align:start;padding:1.15rem 1.4rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.96rem;color:var(--plum);transition:color .25s}
  .faq-q:hover{color:var(--terracotta)}
  .faq-icon{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum);display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:1rem;transition:transform .35s, background .35s, color .35s;font-weight:400}
  .faq-item.open .faq-icon{background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff;transform:rotate(45deg)}
  .faq-a{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height .4s ease, padding .4s ease;padding:0 1.4rem}
  .faq-item.open .faq-a{max-height:400px;padding:0 1.4rem 1.2rem}
  .faq-a p{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}

  /* النشرة */
  .newsletter{border-radius:var(--radius-lg);padding:3.2rem 2rem;text-align:center;background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(184,146,90,.3)}
  .newsletter::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-100px;inset-inline-end:-100px;width:280px;height:280px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(196,122,92,.35), transparent 70%)}
  .newsletter::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-120px;inset-inline-start:-80px;width:300px;height:300px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(155,170,135,.25), transparent 70%)}
  .newsletter h2{font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.2rem);font-weight:900;margin-bottom:.6rem;position:relative;color:var(--cream)}
  .newsletter p{opacity:.8;font-size:.93rem;margin-bottom:1.8rem;position:relative}
  .sub-form{display:flex;gap:.5rem;max-width:500px;margin:0 auto;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);padding:.42rem;border-radius:999px;position:relative;border:1px solid rgba(184,146,90,.35)}
  .sub-form input{flex:1;border:none;background:transparent;outline:none;padding:.72rem 1.1rem;color:var(--cream);font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif;font-size:.9rem}
  .sub-form input::placeholder{color:rgba(242,234,217,.5)}
  .sub-form button{background:var(--gold);color:var(--plum);padding:.72rem 1.6rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:900;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-size:.84rem;transition:transform .25s, background .25s}
  .sub-form button:hover{transform:scale(1.04);background:var(--gold-light)}
  .sub-tags{display:flex;gap:.4rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.2rem;position:relative}
  .sub-tag{font-size:.72rem;color:rgba(242,234,217,.7);padding:.28rem .75rem;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(184,146,90,.3);cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s}
  .sub-tag:hover{color:var(--gold-light);border-color:var(--gold-light)}

  /* الفوتر */
  footer{background:var(--surface);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:3.5rem 0 1.5rem;margin-top:4rem}
  .foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:2rem;padding-bottom:2.4rem}
  .foot-grid h4{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--burgundy);margin-bottom:.9rem}
  .foot-grid ul{display:grid;gap:.5rem}
  .foot-grid a{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);transition:color .25s, padding .25s}
  .foot-grid a:hover{color:var(--terracotta);padding-inline-start:5px}
  .foot-about p{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:.9rem;max-width:32ch}
  .socials{display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1.1rem}
  .socials a{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.9rem;background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum);transition:transform .28s, background .28s, color .28s}
  .socials a:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream)}
  .payments{display:flex;gap:.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}
  .payments span{padding:.3rem .7rem;border-radius:8px;background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;border:1px solid var(--line)}

  .copy{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:1.4rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .copy span:last-child{color:var(--burgundy);font-weight:600}

  /* الطبقة الخلفية */
  .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(43,30,36,.5);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(4px);z-index:100;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .3s, visibility .3s}
  .overlay.show{opacity:1;visibility:visible}

  /* الدُرج */
  .drawer{position:fixed;top:0;bottom:0;width:min(420px,92vw);background:var(--bg);z-index:150;display:flex;flex-direction:column;box-shadow:0 0 80px -20px rgba(43,30,36,.5);transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.05)}
  .drawer.from-left{left:0;transform:translateX(-105%)}
  .drawer.from-right{right:0;transform:translateX(105%)}
  .drawer.open{transform:none}
  .drawer-head{padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}
  .drawer-head h3{font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
  .drawer-head h3 small{font-size:.73rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif}
  .close-btn{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum);font-size:1.05rem;transition:transform .25s, background .25s, color .25s}
  .close-btn:hover{background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff;transform:rotate(90deg)}
  .drawer-body{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:1.2rem 1.4rem}
  .drawer-foot{padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}

  /* السلة */
  .cart-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:68px 1fr auto;gap:.85rem;padding:.85rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);animation:pop .4s ease both}
  .cart-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .cart-thumb{width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.9rem;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cart-info h4{font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.15rem;line-height:1.4}
  .cart-info .meta{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:.45rem}
  .cart-info .meta b{color:var(--terracotta);font-weight:700}
  .qty{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface)}
  .qty button{width:26px;height:26px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--plum);font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;transition:background .2s, color .2s}
  .qty button:hover{background:var(--cream);color:var(--terracotta)}
  .qty span{min-width:24px;text-align:center;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif}
  .cart-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between}
  .cart-side .price{font-size:.92rem}
  .remove{color:var(--muted);font-size:.7rem;transition:color .25s}
  .remove:hover{color:var(--burgundy)}

  .cart-empty{text-align:center;padding:3rem 1rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .cart-empty .icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:.7rem;opacity:.5}
  .cart-empty p{margin-bottom:1.4rem;font-size:.9rem}

  .cart-summary{display:grid;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:1.1rem}
  .sum-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .sum-row.total{font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;padding-top:.65rem;margin-top:.4rem;border-top:1.5px dashed var(--line)}
  .sum-row.total span:last-child{color:var(--burgundy)}
  .free-ship{background:var(--cream);border-radius:12px;padding:.65rem .85rem;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:1rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
  .free-ship b{color:var(--terra-dark);font-weight:700}

  /* المفضلة */
  .wish-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:62px 1fr auto;gap:.8rem;padding:.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);align-items:center}
  .wish-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
  .wish-thumb{width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.7rem;border:1px solid var(--line)}
  .wish-info h4{font-size:.86rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.15rem}
  .wish-info .price{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--terra-dark)}
  .wish-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem;align-items:flex-end}
  .wish-actions .btn-sm{padding:.35rem .8rem;font-size:.72rem}
  .wish-actions .remove{font-size:.7rem}

  /* البحث */
  .search-overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:160;background:rgba(250,246,241,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .3s, visibility .3s;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:2rem 0}
  .search-overlay.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
  .search-head{display:flex;gap:.8rem;align-items:center;max-width:720px;margin-inline:auto;width:92%}
  .search-box{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;background:var(--surface);border-radius:999px;padding:.45rem .45rem .45rem 1.2rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border:1.5px solid var(--line);transition:border-color .25s}
  .search-box:focus-within{border-color:var(--terracotta)}
  .search-box svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:var(--muted);stroke-width:2;flex-shrink:0}
  .search-box input{flex:1;border:none;background:transparent;outline:none;padding:.65rem 0;font-size:1.02rem;color:var(--plum);font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif}
  .search-box input::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
  .search-results{max-width:720px;margin:1.8rem auto 0;width:92%;overflow-y:auto;flex:1}
  .search-result{display:grid;grid-template-columns:58px 1fr auto;gap:.85rem;align-items:center;padding:.8rem;border-radius:16px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:.55rem;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .25s, border-color .25s, box-shadow .25s}
  .search-result:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--gold-light);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  .search-result .thumb-sm{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:14px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.6rem}
  .search-result h4{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum)}
  .search-result .cat{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .search-result .price{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--terra-dark)}
  .search-empty{text-align:center;padding:3rem 1rem;color:var(--muted)}
  .search-empty span{font-size:2.5rem;display:block;margin-bottom:.5rem;opacity:.4}
  .search-tip{text-align:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);padding:1rem 0;max-width:620px;margin-inline:auto}
  .search-tip b{color:var(--terracotta);font-weight:700}

  /* المودال */
  .modal{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:170;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:1.5rem;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .3s, visibility .3s}
  .modal.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
  .modal-box{background:var(--surface);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);width:min(880px,100%);max-height:90vh;overflow-y:auto;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);transform:scale(.94);transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.2);position:relative}
  .modal.open .modal-box{transform:none}
  .modal-close{position:absolute;top:1rem;inset-inline-end:1rem;width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.1rem;z-index:5;transition:transform .25s, background .25s, color .25s}
  .modal-close:hover{background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff;transform:rotate(90deg)}
  .qv-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0}
  .qv-visual{aspect-ratio:1/1;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:7.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius-lg) 0 0 var(--radius-lg);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .qv-visual::after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.65), transparent 55%)}
  .qv-visual .badge{position:absolute;top:1.1rem;inset-inline-start:1.1rem}
  .qv-info{padding:2.2rem 2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .qv-info .p-cat{font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--terracotta);margin-bottom:.4rem}
  .qv-info h2{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.5rem;line-height:1.4}
  .qv-info .p-rate{margin-bottom:.9rem}
  .qv-info .price{font-size:1.35rem;margin-bottom:1.1rem;display:inline-block}
  .qv-info .price s{font-size:.86rem}
  .qv-desc{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1.4rem;padding-bottom:1.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .qv-label{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
  .qv-label button{color:var(--terracotta);font-size:.73rem;font-weight:600;transition:color .25s}
  .qv-label button:hover{color:var(--burgundy);text-decoration:underline}
  .sizes{display:flex;gap:.45rem;margin-bottom:1.3rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .size-btn{min-width:44px;padding:.5rem .85rem;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:var(--bg);color:var(--plum);font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;font-size:.83rem;transition:all .25s}
  .size-btn:hover{border-color:var(--terracotta);color:var(--terracotta)}
  .size-btn.active{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);border-color:var(--plum)}
  .qv-qty-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.4rem}
  .qv-qty-row .qty{border-width:1.5px}
  .qv-qty-row .qty button{width:34px;height:34px;font-size:1.05rem}
  .qv-qty-row .qty span{min-width:34px;font-size:.92rem}
  .qv-actions{display:flex;gap:.65rem;margin-top:auto}
  .qv-actions .btn{flex:1}

  /* زر الأعلى */
  .to-top{position:fixed;bottom:1.5rem;left:1.5rem;z-index:90;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.95rem;color:#fff;background:var(--plum);box-shadow:var(--shadow);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(16px);transition:.35s}
  .to-top.show{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none}
  .to-top:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);background:var(--burgundy)}
  .to-top svg{width:17px;height:17px;stroke-width:2.5}

  /* واتساب عائم */
  .fab{position:fixed;bottom:1.5rem;right:1.5rem;z-index:90;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem;align-items:flex-end}
  .fab-btn{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.4rem;color:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:transform .3s, background .3s;position:relative}
  .fab-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.05)}
  .fab-btn.whatsapp{background:#25d366}
  .fab-btn.chat{background:var(--plum)}
  .fab-btn.chat::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:-4px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--plum);opacity:0;animation:pulse 2.2s infinite}
  @keyframes pulse{0%{opacity:.7;transform:scale(.9)}100%{opacity:0;transform:scale(1.3)}}
  .fab-btn .fab-tip{position:absolute;right:calc(100% + 10px);top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);padding:.4rem .85rem;border-radius:8px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s}
  .fab-btn:hover .fab-tip{opacity:1}

  /* نافذة المحادثة */
  .chat-window{position:fixed;bottom:5.5rem;right:1.5rem;z-index:95;width:min(340px,90vw);background:var(--surface);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);border:1px solid var(--line);overflow:hidden;transform:translateY(20px) scale(.95);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:.35s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.2)}
  .chat-window.open{transform:none;opacity:1;visibility:visible}
  .chat-head{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);padding:1rem 1.2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem}
  .chat-head .av{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--terracotta),var(--gold));display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700;font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif}
  .chat-head .info strong{display:block;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:700}
  .chat-head .info span{font-size:.72rem;opacity:.7;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem}
  .chat-head .info span::before{content:'';width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#25d366}
  .chat-head .close{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.9rem;margin-inline-start:auto;transition:background .25s}
  .chat-head .close:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.22)}
  .chat-body{padding:1.2rem;max-height:280px;overflow-y:auto;background:var(--cream)}
  .msg{background:var(--surface);padding:.65rem .9rem;border-radius:14px 14px 14px 4px;font-size:.83rem;color:var(--plum);margin-bottom:.6rem;max-width:85%;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);line-height:1.7}
  .msg.me{background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);margin-inline-start:auto;border-radius:14px 14px 4px 14px}
  .chat-foot{padding:.7rem;background:var(--surface);display:flex;gap:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .chat-foot input{flex:1;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:.55rem 1rem;outline:none;font-size:.83rem;background:var(--bg);color:var(--plum);transition:border-color .25s;font-family:'Tajawal',sans-serif}
  .chat-foot input:focus{border-color:var(--terracotta)}
  .chat-foot button{width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.95rem;transition:background .25s}
  .chat-foot button:hover{background:var(--burgundy)}

  /* شريط المشاهدات الأخيرة */
  .recent-bar{position:fixed;bottom:0;right:0;left:0;z-index:85;background:var(--surface);border-top:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 -12px 30px -20px rgba(74,47,58,.6);transform:translateY(105%);transition:transform .45s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.2);padding:.6rem 0}
  .recent-bar.show{transform:none}
  .recent-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:nowrap;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:.2rem}
  .recent-label{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--plum);font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;white-space:nowrap;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;flex-shrink:0}
  .recent-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.35rem .7rem;border-radius:999px;background:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--line);cursor:pointer;transition:all .25s;flex-shrink:0}
  .recent-item:hover{background:var(--blush);border-color:var(--gold-light)}
  .recent-item .re-emoji{font-size:1.2rem}
  .recent-item .re-name{font-size:.76rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--plum);max-width:140px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
  .recent-close{margin-inline-start:auto;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cream);color:var(--plum);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:.85rem;flex-shrink:0;transition:background .25s}
  .recent-close:hover{background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff}

  /* شريط الموافقة على الكوكيز */
  .cookie{position:fixed;bottom:1.5rem;right:50%;transform:translate(50%,180%);z-index:99;width:min(680px,92vw);background:var(--surface);border-radius:20px;padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);border:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.3)}
  .cookie.show{transform:translate(50%,0)}
  .cookie-icon{font-size:1.6rem}
  .cookie-text{flex:1;min-width:200px;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}
  .cookie-text b{color:var(--plum);font-weight:700}
  .cookie-actions{display:flex;gap:.5rem}

  /* توست */
  .toast{position:fixed;bottom:5rem;right:50%;transform:translate(50%,180%);background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream);padding:.8rem 1.4rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);z-index:250;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.35);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;max-width:90vw;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(184,146,90,.4)}
  .toast.show{transform:translate(50%,0)}
  .toast svg{width:15px;height:15px;stroke:var(--gold-light);stroke-width:2.2;flex-shrink:0}

  /* الظهور التدريجي */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

  /* الاستجابة */
  @media (max-width:1100px){
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr}
  }
  @media (max-width:960px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;gap:2.5rem}
    .hero p.lead{margin-inline:auto}
    .btn-row,.hero-stats{justify-content:center}
    .hero-visual{order:-1}
    .hero-card{width:min(100%,300px);font-size:7rem}
    .chip.c1{right:0}
    .chip.c2{left:0}
    .chip.c3{display:none}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .promo,.featured{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center;padding:2.5rem 1.5rem}
    .promo p,.featured p{margin-inline:auto}
    .quotes{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .quote:not(.active){display:none}
    .insta-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
    .qv-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .qv-visual{border-radius:var(--radius-lg) var(--radius-lg) 0 0;aspect-ratio:1/.85;font-size:6rem}
    .qv-info{padding:1.7rem 1.5rem}
    .lookbook{height:auto;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;grid-template-rows:auto}
    .look.large,.look.wide{grid-column:auto;grid-row:auto}
    .look{aspect-ratio:1/1;font-size:3rem}
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    nav{position:fixed;top:0;bottom:0;right:0;width:min(280px,82%);background:var(--surface);padding:6rem 2rem 2rem;box-shadow:-20px 0 60px -30px rgba(74,47,58,.6);transform:translateX(105%);transition:transform .4s ease;z-index:90}
    nav.open{transform:none}
    nav ul{flex-direction:column;gap:1.3rem;font-size:1.02rem}
    .burger{display:grid;place-items:center;z-index:95}
    .hero{padding:2.2rem 0 3rem;min-height:auto}
    section{padding:3.2rem 0}
    .newsletter{padding:2.5rem 1.3rem;border-radius:22px}
    .sub-form{flex-direction:column;border-radius:24px;padding:.75rem}
    .sub-form button{width:100%}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.8rem}
    .copy{justify-content:center;text-align:center}
    .to-top{left:1rem;bottom:5.5rem;width:40px;height:40px}
    .hero-stats{gap:1.3rem}
    .hero-stats > div{padding-inline-start:.85rem}
    .shop-toolbar{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
    .sort-box{justify-content:space-between}
    .sort-box select{flex:1}
    .timer .unit{min-width:60px;padding:.7rem .75rem}
    .timer .unit b{font-size:1.3rem}
    .trust-inner{justify-content:center;gap:.7rem}
    .trust-item{font-size:.76rem}
    .insta-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    .fab{bottom:4.5rem;right:1rem}
    .fab-btn{width:46px;height:46px;font-size:1.2rem}
    .chat-window{bottom:8.5rem;right:1rem}
    .cookie{bottom:5rem;padding:1rem 1.1rem}
    .cookie-actions{width:100%}
    .cookie-actions .btn{flex:1}
    .toast{bottom:9rem}
    .recent-bar{padding:.5rem 0}
    .recent-label{font-size:.72rem}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- شريط الإعلان -->
<div class="announce">
  <span>توصيل مجاني للطلبات فوق ٢٠٠ ر.س <em>✦</em> خصم ١٥٪ بكود <em>HALA15</em></span>
  <span class="count-pill" id="announceTimer">ينتهي خلال <b id="t-h">٠٤</b>:<b id="t-m">٣٢</b>:<b id="t-s">١٨</b></span>
</div>

<!-- الهيدر -->
<header>
  <div class="container nav-wrap">
    <button class="icon-btn burger" id="burger" aria-label="القائمة">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18"/></svg>
    </button>

    <a href="#" class="logo"><span class="mark">✿</span><span class="name">حلا</span></a>

    <nav id="nav">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#shop">المتجر</a></li>
        <li><a href="#categories">الأقسام</a></li>
        <li><a href="#lookbook">اللوك بوك</a></li>
        <li><a href="#loyalty">نادي حلا</a></li>
        <li><a href="#blog">المجلة</a></li>
        <li><a href="#faq">الأسئلة</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="header-actions">
      <button class="icon-btn" id="searchBtn" aria-label="بحث">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="icon-btn" id="wishlistBtn" aria-label="المفضلة">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8l1 1L12 21l7.8-7.6 1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8z"/></svg>
        <span class="badge-count hidden" id="wishCount">0</span>
      </button>
      <button class="icon-btn" id="cartBtn" aria-label="سلة التسوق">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><path d="M3 6h18M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg>
        <span class="badge-count hidden" id="cartCount">0</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- الهيرو -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <!-- السلايد 1 -->
      <div class="hero-slide active" data-slide="0">
        <span class="eyebrow">تشكيلة الربيع ٢٠٢٦</span>
        <h1>أناقة راقية<br>تليق <span class="grad">بذوقكِ</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">أهلاً بكِ في <strong>حلا</strong> — متجر مختار بعناية، فيه فساتين، حقائب، مكياج وإكسسوارات تُكمّل إطلالتك بلمسة راقية.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href="#shop" class="btn btn-primary">تسوّقي الآن</a>
          <a href="#categories" class="btn btn-ghost">تصفّحي الأقسام</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- السلايد 2 -->
      <div class="hero-slide" data-slide="1">
        <span class="eyebrow">وصل حديثاً</span>
        <h1>قطع <span class="grad">جديدة</span><br>كل أسبوع</h1>
        <p class="lead">تشكيلة متجددة من القطع الراقية المختارة يدوياً، كل قطعة بشغف وذوق عالي.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href="#shop" class="btn btn-primary">تسوّقي الجديد</a>
          <a href="#loyalty" class="btn btn-ghost">انضمي للنادي</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- السلايد 3 -->
      <div class="hero-slide" data-slide="2">
        <span class="eyebrow">عرض خاص</span>
        <h1>خصم <span class="grad">٢٥٪</span><br>لفترة محدودة</h1>
        <p class="lead">استفيدي من أقوى عروض الموسم على تشكيلة مختارة. العرض ينتهي قريباً — لا تفوّتيه.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a href="#offer" class="btn btn-primary">شوفي العرض</a>
          <a href="#shop" class="btn btn-ghost">تصفّحي المتجر</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-dots" id="heroDots">
        <button class="hero-dot active" data-hero="0" aria-label="سلايد ١"></button>
        <button class="hero-dot" data-hero="1" aria-label="سلايد ٢"></button>
        <button class="hero-dot" data-hero="2" aria-label="سلايد ٣"></button>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div><strong>+٢٤٠٠</strong><span>عميلة سعيدة</span></div>
        <div><strong>+٣٥٠</strong><span>منتج متنوّع</span></div>
        <div><strong>٤.٩</strong><span>متوسط التقييم</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="hero-card"><span class="emoji-big" id="heroEmoji">👗</span></div>
      <div class="chip c1">توصيل مجاني</div>
      <div class="chip c2">تقييم ٤.٩</div>
      <div class="chip c3">تغليف هدية</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- شريط الثقة -->
<div class="trust-strip">
  <div class="container trust-inner">
    <div class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7h11v10H3zM14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2"/></svg><span>توصيل سريع لكل المدن</span></div>
    <div class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg><span>دفع آمن ١٠٠٪</span></div>
    <div class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 18 0 9 9 0 0 0-18 0zM12 7v5l3 2"/></svg><span>إرجاع خلال ١٤ يوم</span></div>
    <div class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m12 2 3 6.5 7 .9-5 4.9 1.2 7L12 18l-6.2 3.3L7 14.3l-5-4.9 7-.9z"/></svg><span>جودة مختارة بعناية</span></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ماركات -->
<div class="press">
  <div class="container press-inner">
    <div class="press-item">VOGUE ARABIA</div>
    <div class="press-item">ELLE</div>
    <div class="press-item">HARPER'S BAZAAR</div>
    <div class="press-item">MARIE CLAIRE</div>
    <div class="press-item">COSMOPOLITAN</div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- الأقسام -->
<section id="categories">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">الأقسام</span>
      <h2>اختاري <span class="grad">ستايلك</span> المفضّل</h2>
      <p>من الفساتين الناعمة إلى الإكسسوارات الصغيرة — كل شي مرتب ومختار بعناية.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cats" id="catsGrid"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- المنتجات -->
<section id="shop" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">المتجر</span>
      <h2>القطع <span class="grad">المفضّلة</span> عند بناتنا</h2>
      <p>أكثر القطع المطلوبة هذا الموسم — اطلبيها قبل ما تخلص.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tabs" id="tabs">
      <button class="tab active" data-tab="best">الأكثر مبيعاً</button>
      <button class="tab" data-tab="new">وصل حديثاً</button>
      <button class="tab" data-tab="sale">العروض</button>
    </div>

    <div class="shop-toolbar">
      <div class="filters" id="filters"></div>
      <div class="sort-box">
        <label for="sort">ترتيب:</label>
        <select id="sort">
          <option value="popular">الأكثر رواجاً</option>
          <option value="price-asc">السعر: من الأقل</option>
          <option value="price-desc">السعر: من الأعلى</option>
          <option value="rating">الأعلى تقييماً</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="products" id="products"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Featured Collection -->
<section style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="featured reveal">
      <div class="featured-content">
        <span class="promo-tag" style="background:var(--plum);color:var(--cream)">مجموعة مختارة</span>
        <h2>مجموعة <span class="grad">الصيف</span> الجديدة</h2>
        <p>قطع خفيفة بألوان ترابية هادئة تناسب كل الإطلالات. مصنوعة من أقمشة عالية الجودة تتنفّس وتبقى أنيقة طوال اليوم.</p>
        <a href="#shop" class="btn btn-primary">تصفّحي المجموعة</a>
      </div>
      <div class="featured-visual">
        <div class="fv-item" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#f5e2d6,#dbb89e)">👗</div>
        <div class="fv-item" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#f0dbdc,#cfa5a6)">👜</div>
        <div class="fv-item" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#dfe6d5,#a8b48f)">👡</div>
        <div class="fv-item" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#f0e2c8,#c9a86a)">💍</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Lookbook -->
<section id="lookbook">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">اللوك بوك</span>
      <h2>إطلالات <span class="grad">منسّقة</span> لك</h2>
      <p>تنسيقات جاهزة اختارها فريق حلا لتسهيل إطلالتك اليومية.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lookbook reveal">
      <div class="look large" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#f5e2d6,#dbb89e)">
        👗<span class="look-label">إطلالة نهارية</span>
      </div>
      <div class="look" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#f0e2c8,#c9a86a)">
        👜<span class="look-label">حقائب أنيقة</span>
      </div>
      <div class="look" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#f0dbdc,#cfa5a6)">
        💄<span class="look-label">لمسة جمال</span>
      </div>
      <div class="look wide" style="background:linear-gradient(150deg,#dfe6d5,#a8b48f)">
        🌿<span class="look-label">إطلالة طبيعية</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- العرض الخاص -->
<section id="offer" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="promo reveal">
      <div class="promo-content">
        <span class="promo-tag">عرض لفترة محدودة</span>
        <h2>خصم ٢٥٪ على تشكيلة مختارة</h2>
        <p>استفيدي من العرض على أجمل القطع هذا الموسم. العرض ينتهي قريباً — لا تفوّتيه.</p>
        <a href="#shop" class="btn btn-gold">تسوّقي العرض</a>
      </div>
      <div class="timer" id="timer">
        <div class="unit"><b id="d-d">٠٠</b><span>يوم</span></div>
        <div class="unit"><b id="d-h">٠٠</b><span>ساعة</span></div>
        <div class="unit"><b id="d-m">٠٠</b><span>دقيقة</span></div>
        <div class="unit"><b id="d-s">٠٠</b><span>ثانية</span></div>
